OL,3,APope Leo XIV becomes first pontiff to
OL,4,Avote in a US election
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has submitted his mail-in
OL,7,Fballot in Illinois, for the midterm
OL,8,Felections, becoming the first-ever pope
OL,9,Fto vote in a US election.
OL,11,F"The Holy Father expresses his belief
OL,12,Fin the right and the duty of citizens
OL,13,Fto participate in democratic
OL,14,Fprocesses," the Holy See Press Office
OL,15,Fsaid in a statement.
OL,17,FThe Chicago-born pontiff is the first
OL,18,FUS citizen to hold the Vatican's
OL,19,Fhighest seat, after his selection in
OL,20,FMay 2025.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
